    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Substations rehabilitated 
Indicator: 500 kV Regar and 200 kV Geran, Asht, Rumi, Baipaza and Kairakum substations rehabilitated and are operational by mid-2014 
Achievement: 0 
Progress/Status: Lot 2: PDSI contract between BT and Alstom Grid Enerji Endustri A.S-Genser Genel Muhendislik Taahhut ve Ticaret A.S Consortium was signed on 18 November 2013 and became effective on 23 December 2013. Contract and all works are successfully completed on 30 November 2016.

220kV Rumi substation rehabilitation was completed in August 2016.
220kV Baypaza substation rehabilitation was completed in September 2016.
New 220/110kV Geran-2 substation construction was completed in October 2016.
220kV Kayrakum and Asht substations rehabilitation were completed in 2016.
500kV Regar substation rehabilitation was completed in August 2016. 
Data Source: Barki Tojik annual reports

